o\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">On the second floor of a ruined building in <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul\">Roshamuul</a>, east-northeast of the depot, slightly north of the central mountain</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mortis\">Mortis</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mortis\"><img alt=\"Mortis\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mortis_16cbec.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Inquisitor</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">On the bridge between Lower and Central <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul\">Roshamuul</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandomo\">Sandomo</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sandomo\"><img alt=\"Sandomo\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Sandomo_3e01da.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Inquisitor</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></td><td style=\"\">Lower <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul\">Roshamuul</a></td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px;\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Siestaar\">Siestaar</a></td><td class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px; text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Siestaar\"><img alt=\"Siestaar\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Siestaar_210f83.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></td><td style=\"width: 110px; text-align: center;\">Inquisitor</td><td style=\"width: 72px; text-align: center;\"><span class=